[ 'V' BIND V 0 MUL 1 ADD 0 [ ADD ] SCAN 1 SUB 'I' BIND V 0 GET 1 SUB 1 COLLECT V -1 DROP CONCAT 'P' BIND V P SUB 'D' BIND D D MUL 0 GT 'F' BIND I F 2 COLLECT ZIP [ 1 GET ] FILTER [ 0 GET ] MAP ] 'E0B.STARTS' DEF
[ 'N' BIND 1 N RANGE [ 'D' BIND N N D DIV FLOOR D MUL SUB 1 LT ] FILTER ] 'E0B.DIVISORS' DEF
[ 'S' BIND 0 6 RANGE S [ 'E' BIND '()' '' REPLACE '[]' '' REPLACE ] FOLD ] 'E0B.REDUCE' DEF
[ [ ' ' 2 COLLECT JOIN ] MAP JOIN TRIM ] 'E0B.JOINSP' DEF
[ LOWER ' ' TOKENIZE [ '' EQ NOT ] FILTER ] 'E0B.WORDS' DEF
[ JSON-DECODE 'orders' GET 'OS' BIND OS [ 'sku' GET ] MAP OS [ 'qty' GET ] MAP GROUP 'G' BIND G KEYS G VALUES [ 0 [ ADD ] FOLD ] MAP RECORD ] 'E0B.QTYSKU' DEF
'  The cat saw THE dog   and the Cat  '
E0B.WORDS UNIQUE SORT E0B.JOINSP
